<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">BaKolosi</para>
  <para style="toc3">BaKo</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaKolosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aKolosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">BaKolosi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aKolosi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Kufumung e ne na aBulus, atom aYeso Kristi ni kushim Adakunom, nɛ aruneng yit aTimoti. <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Ba tom iko sak na banet Adakunom, baruneng atsak fɛ́ ba se kufiri na Anet-Isheshek na aKolosi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Won itek ni kusot kukyang fi ku nes na Ada yit Adakunom ni ku se ni yin.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus nesek ifeng <optbreak /> ni iras awon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />In nesek yit Adakunom, Ada aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ifeng kaakyi izen, fi in ki ras yin awon. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Nek in mi fok yit, inɔɔk atsak yin na Anet-Isheshek aYeso ni ishim fi ibɛ yin sak na banet Adakunom ngma kusum. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />I nye yin anɔng, nek ite iyɛ ni ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom mi ki sak yin ne azanɛn, idɔng fi i mi tsang fok yin ayɛt ifɛ̀ atsak, fi i yet Ifɛ Itek <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />fi i mi bɛ́ ni yin. Ngma azatse Ifɛ Itek e deng tsin shesheng áyɛ banet, i tsin bang rasak, kpaf ti fi i tsin nye nate yin, neme kunom fi i kin fok yin ide, i bi rēn yin ngma itek Adakunom ayɛt atsak. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Iyin mɛɛs yin ide na afidang itomong yit Apafaras, iwu fɛ́ a yet afi itomong Anet-Isheshek ayɛt atsak akuce yit, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />iwu mi ki tak yit ishim fi i nye yin ayɛt abik Adakunom.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Nek anɔng, neme atuk fi in kin fok yit ifɛ̀ naton yin, in mi wosong yit ira awon nek iyin awo, in nye yit na Adakunom na ki shining yin ni irēn ishim wu, ni i rēn yin ngma kutsitsɛng fi ku nes na abik wu gbɛngɛrɛng. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />In ras yit awon anɔng, nɔng iyin da kyem ni nye yin kusot fi ku tseng kpaf ni kusot aTisa, ni ku tɛrɛk yin iyɛ na kaakyi irèn: ni sɛs yin kurasak ayɛt kaakyi kutomong kutek, nɔng i da bang rēn yin Adakunom tsik-tsik. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Won ni sɛs yin agap kpaf ni kukyem ízɔk wu, nɔng i da sɛ yin iyit iyɛ makiyi nɛ akabɔk ni nesek yin ifeng na Adakunom yit. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Iwu fɛ́ a ki nye yin irèn isɛ kanu kafiin, ayɛt iya itekari bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba bi sɛ ni igwɔm mgbey. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Nek iwu mi ki tun yit na ngamang ahwyi, a mi bɛ́ ni iyit ayɛt igwɔm Ari wu fi iwu shim, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />ni wu fɛ́ ba ki bisik yit mo, ba ki fuut yit mo anɛn yit.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iratek Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />AYeso Kristi yet ikyɛng idi Adakunom, nek Adakunom ba kyem ba ku di awo, Anet-Isheshek me yet nggon imɛsɛng e azaton nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba nye. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Ni wu Adakunom di nye kaakyi ikyɛng ni kubɔk wu: nkyɔrɔk fi in se azanɛn ni nfɛ́ azatse, nyɔng fɛ́ ba yere ni nyɔng fɛ́ ba di ina awo, ke ni in yet ata igwɔm ke bafɛ́ agap ke bágwɔm ke bafi kukyem ayi; ngma nkyɔrɔk e nang iwu fɛ́ a nye ina, mok ice wu. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Anet-Isheshek wu a yet kashon akaakyɛ, ni wu fɛ́ ngma nkyɔrɔk kana yisik mo gyat na narɔ na. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Iwu fɛ́ a yet ice kurɔm e, itusung bafi ikuus; iwu fɛ́ a yet afi imɛsɛng e nɛ afi imɛsɛng ayɛt idorok bafaben, nɔng ayɛt akaakyɛ iwu da sot afɛ́ ashon. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Nek Adakunom kin bɛ́ kafa kakan na ku shining ni nse wu ngma kusum. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Ayɛt wu fɛ́ Adakunom di bɛ́ ni inosong-ashi na akaakyi ikyɛng. Ke nin in yet nkyɔrɔk fi in se azatse ke in yɔng fi in se azanɛn ayi. AYeso bɛ́ ni kusot kukyang ni irèn inosong nasok wu naton kukum e.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Ayame iyin tsang se yin yik-yik na Adakunom. Áyɛ yin se ni ifa na Adakunom, iras yin anyas. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, a mi nosong-ashi ni iyin, ni irèn iku aKristi, fɛ́ a nye ni kurɔm wu, nɔng a da ki nabak yin ashon Adakunom, jɛrɛ, vit inɛn, vit ikyɛng itsɛt inɛn. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />I se gbing-gbing ni ya yin kashon ni inɔɔk atsak yin, ni kuta yin aney tsik, nyeseng yin gey, vit iserek ni ite iyɛ fi i mi sɛ yin ni Ifɛ itek. Ifɛ Itek e deng fi i kin fok yin, idɔng fɛ́ ba mi taas sak na akaangan azatse, fi imi aBulus mi di sot asam.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutomong fɛ́ aBulus ra <optbreak /> itusung bafi ikuus e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />In bi iyɛ ikan nek izot fi in sɔ mok iyin, nɔng ayɛt irɔm in, in di ya kashon ni izot fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek sɔ, nek itek irɔm wu, fi ku yet itusung bafi ikuus. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Imi mi sot asam ko, nek ikasa fɛ́ Adakunom di nye ne, nɔng in da ki nesek yin ifɛ̀ Adakunom juut-juut. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Ikyɛng fi i kin se ni nɛt ayɛ na ayɛ, awɛt kyɔrɔng ba mi tarak banet Adakunom ide. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Ishim Adakunom yet na a sak Ícɛn-iduk ni irēn itek kurúm wu, fi ku tsang se ni nɛt, fi ku yet kufiri na Anet-Isheshek, yet ite iyɛ itek.<verse eid="COL 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Nek anɔng, in shara yit ifɛ̀ wu, in kɔk yit banet ato, ni in tees banet ayɛt kutsitsɛng, nɔng in da bin nabak yit kaangan gyatgyat ayɛt Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Nek anɔng wu fi in tsin kana bung mo ni tomong, ni in di muu ice ayɛt agap wu, fɛ́ a se ni kutomong ni imi gyet awo.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Imi shim ni irēn yin anyɛk fi in se ne nek iyin, nɛ banet Adakunom fɛ́ ba se na aLaudikiya, ngma ni ishɛrɛp bafi ikuus fɛ́ da ba man nyim ni imi awo. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />In nye anɔng, nek in ka ba gbinding mo. Ama fɛ́ áyɛ bá mi kana moon ni ishim, nɔng ba bin sɛ kutsik irēn, nɔng ba di ki rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom kin nɛt, fɛ́ ba yes Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Ni wu fi in di sɛ yit ngma kudot kutsitsɛng ni irēn fi ku tsang se ni nɛt. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />In tsin ki tak yin anɔng, kɔn akak bi ki wɔrɔk yin na arɔtɔt anu. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Ngma ne fi da in se gung ni iyin ni irɔm awo, in se gung ni iyin ayɛt abik. In bi iyɛ ikan ifok, fok kutseet yin se gyat ni itup ijɛng yin na atsak fi i bɛ́ yin na Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikuus Anet-Isheshek <optbreak /> ibɛ́ ni kusot kufas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Iyin mi shan yin Anet-Isheshek aYeso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 3:20">Ntomong Batom 3:20</ref></char>.</note>, a sot aTisa yin, anɔng, ya yin kashon ni kusot kufiri ni wu. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Ta yin aney, kana nok yin ni wu, nyeseng yin na agap ni inɔɔk atsak tɛ ba kin ki tees yin mo. Shining yin ni kusot inesek ifeng na Adakunom.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Nye yin yɛɛt, kɔng akak bi ki sak in ni isam ni irèn kuyiring ice wu, fi ku yet itees banet awe ifɛ́ abap, ni ikuus itees nggɔn naban-abik azatse kang, na aza itees Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="COL 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Ayɛt Anet-Isheshek, ngma nse Adakunom di sot kusum ni wu. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Wat iyin, ba mi ki nɔk yin atsitsak kutset ayɛt kufiri yin na Anet-Isheshek, fɛ́ a yet ice naton akaakyɛ igwɔm ni kukyem. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Ayɛɛt wu fɛ́ ba ki ya yin katse bà, iya katse ifas e yeng da i yet kuri iyɔng fɛ́ banet nyes ni mbɔk awo, tit iya katse iyɔng fɛ́ ba nye na Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Abaptisma yin se ti i ku yin gung na Anet-Isheshek, ba tɛ ba ki nɛt yin ni wu, ba tɛ ba ki donong yin gung ni wu ni irèn inɔɔk atsak yin ni kukyem Adakunom, fɛ́ a donong Anet-Isheshek ni irɛk.<verse eid="COL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Yame, iyin tsang yet yin nkom me ashon Adakunom, nse yin yet nfi inɛn, Adakunom kin tsang ki nɔk yin nse nfas awo. Awɛt Adakunom ne a ki nɔk yin kutset kufas ni izen fi inɔ yin kufiri na Anet-Isheshek, a ki fuut yit ngma anɛn yit. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Yame, ba tsang ki ya yit ni ishɔt, nek i shorop yit ntsi aMusa, awɛt Adakunom tun ngma ánɛn fɛ́ a tsang ki ya yit ni ishɔt e. A tekak ina ni ikum. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Na anɔng, a di buruk agap akaakyɛ kuri nabik, a tonong dɛt-dɛt fok iwu mi ya agap naton kukyem ni igwɔm, ni irèn itekak wu ni kum.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikuus ntsi kyɛk <optbreak /> kyem in nɔɔk kutset awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Nek anɔng, i bi won yin akak ki te yin ntsi naton ikyɛng fi i da ya yin, ke idɔng fi i da sɔ yin awo, ke ni irèn itosok amok ntsi nkak, ke amok iyɛrɛ nfɛn nfas, ke kunom aSabat ayi. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Ina yet nawu nkyɔrɔk fi in bi bɛ, atitup e yet Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />I bi won yin akak fɛ́ a nyes ifeng ayɛt imen ice mbɔɔs, ni iya batomaza ntong, na a ki buruk yin izang yin awo. Kuri anet yɔng, nɔɔs tsik-tsik ayɛt nabos fi iwu mi di, ni kuyiring ishim ice wu, i ku saas na tsot kukaa ni ishim iyɛ ifɛ́ abap. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Anet kuri ayɔng, mi tɛn ice wu, ni ice me fi iyet Anet-Isheshek. Anet-Isheshek wu fɛ́ a nesek kurɔm agap, na ra kutomong na atsip na di monoso nkap irɔm, na saas ku rasak ni kukyem Adakunom.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Yɔkɔnɔng fi i mi kus yin nɛ Anet-Isheshek, i mi won yin nggɔn naban-abik azatse kang, akyɛ sak i ti ni nasap yin ace yin ni ikuus nggɔn bà ti i resek yin mo gung ni iba yɛ? <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />&lt;&lt;I bi ra awo! I bi rɛs awo! I bi bereng awo!&gt;&gt;? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Kuri ntsi in nang cɛɛt naton nkyɔrɔk yɔng fi da in mak fɔɔn awo. Nek ines ni kuyiring anet awe, ni itees wu. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Ni itumung e, i se na yisi banet tɛ ntsi me bɛ kutsitsɛng, ibɛ́s ni ite iyɛ, ni imen nhwyɛ ayɛt iya ntong, awɛt ngma ne anɔng, i yet mbɔɔs kyɛk. Banet ka zoot nrɔm bà kyɛk, atsak e yet, kuri ntsi me nang bɛ́ agap ikyikak fi i da tɛnɛng anet ni kpa ni izen imara irɔm awo.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s">Irèn ifi kusot aJɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Nek anɔng, ba mi ki donong yin gung nɛ Anet-Isheshek, nabak yin áyɛ yin ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se azanɛn, karɔ fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek di sonong ni bɔk iyak Adakunom. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Te yin àyɛ yin ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se naton, da nkyɔrɔk azatse awo. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Nek ikus yin, kutset yin se ni inɛt ayɛt aKristi, ayɛt Adakunom. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Anet-Isheshek wu a yet kutset yin ku fɛ́ atsak, izen fɛ́ a bi bɛ, i bi bɛ yin gung ni wu ayɛt ízɔk wu.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Nek anɔng, tun yin nggɔn nzen nfɛ́ azatse ayɛt ayɛ yin, nkyɔrɔk tɛ: kutomong irɔs, nɛ iras nkyɔrɔk imaan e, ni kujang, nɛ aduk nggɔn, nɛ ishim ice, anɔng yet iya nabannom ntong. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Nek kuri aduk nggɔn e nang wu fɛ́ naman Adakunom bi di tik naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba dang fok Adakunom. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Iyin tsang tsees yin anɔng, ni nggɔn fi i tsang di se yin. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, i se gbingbing ni i won yin nanan, ni iyɛ ife, ni iberese yin banet ni iyɛ, ni itok, ni ncɛɛt abap. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />I bi ras yin bafidang mbɔɔs awo, nek imang tun yin nggɔn yɔng fi nse izen, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />nek iyin mi sok yin nggɔn nfas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 3:10">Adakunom wu fɛ́ a nye nggɔn nfas e nang fi in se ayɛt yin, a da ya kashon ni nye anɔng, nɔng i da bin sot yin ba fas, i di sok yin nse ayɔng fɛ́ a ki nye yin. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Nek anɔng, i bi won yin ikyikak ni ki kam yin awo, iyin fi ibɛ yin nggɔn nfas e. Kɛ ni yet yin baYahuda kɛ ni yet yin BaGirik ayi, kɛ ba mi ki ya yin katse kɛ vit iya katse, kuzɛɛt di se na anet i bi irēn na anet ayit awo, kuzɛɛt di se na asam ke nggon ari awo, Anet-Isheshek wu a yet kaakyɛ, ayɛt akaakyi ikyɛng.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Nek anɔng, tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi myak, fɛ́ ba se jɛrɛ, fi iwu ka ba shim makiyi, sot yin bafi nggɔn amushish, bafi itek, ni nhwyɛ, bafi imen ice, nɛ akabɔk. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Nye yin akabɔk na bafidang. Fuut yin bafidang anɛn fɛ́ ba ki nye yin e, kyon tɛ aTisa ki fuut yin ne, anɔng wu fi i da fuut yin bafidang anɛn ba ba. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Ayɛt nkyɔrɔk nang ngma, sok yin ishim aza akaakyɛ, iye fi itoos ishɛrɛp e gyat ngma.<verse eid="COL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Won kukyang fi ku nes ne Anet-Isheshek ni ku sot na áyɛ yin, nek ti nkap kurɔm kuzining, ba ki yes yin ni kusot kukyang. Nesek yin ifeng. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Won ifɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek di nak ayɛt ayɛ yin makiyi, ni tees ni itabak yin banet ayɛt kutsitsɛng Adakunom. Ras yin Adakunom abom itere, nɛ abom ice, nɛ abom fɛ́ a nes nabik Adakunom, ni itonoso yin ifeng yin na Adakunom itɛrɛk iyɛ yin. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Ayɛt kaakyɛ fi i da fɛ̀ yin ke i da nye yin ayi, nye yin kaakyɛ ni iyerek aTisa aYeso, nesek ifeng sak na Ada Adakunom ayit iyerek aYeso.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusot fi ku se gyat <optbreak /> bafi ikuus na ba nye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Banyining, nɔɔk yin ice yin sak na batek yin, nek anɔng e se gyat anu shon aTisa.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Batek, shim yin banyining yin, i bi ka ba zot yin awo.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Nnon, fok yin ifɛ̀ bada ni binggɔ yin na akaakyɛ, nek anɔng e tɛrɛk aTisa iyɛ.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Bada, i bi beseng yin nnon yin iyɛ awo. Nek ki i nye yin anɔng, i da ka ba but yin nkap.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Basam, fok yin ifɛ̀ bátékari yin bafɛ́ azatse kang ayɛt kaakyi ikyɛng. I bi ra yin kutomong iyere ayisi tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin tsɛt itere banet awo. Nek anɔng, ra yin kutomong yin ni iyɛ izining ayɛt atsak, tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba foos nnyim Adakunom. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Na akaakyɛ fi i da ra yin, nye yin ide ni iyɛ izining, kyɔn ti i tsin ra yin Adakunom me, da anet awe awo. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Rēn yin fok, Adakunom wu a bi ki nɔɔk yin izang yin azanɛn. Nek aTisa aKristi wu i tsin ku ra yin kutomong. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Anet fɛ́ a ras kutomong anyas, a bi shan izang kutomong anyas wu, nek vit ishim ice.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Bátékari, bereng yin basam yin gyat. Ka ba nyes yin nkyɔrɔk ntek. Yiring yin fok, ibɛ yin Atekari azanɛn bà.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itabak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Nabak yin ace yin ni iras awon, ya yin kashon ni iyɛrɛ, ni inesek ifeng. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Ki ras yit awon bà, nɔng Adakunom da ki tarak yit irèn ishara katsak naton aKristi, in di tas yit ikyɛng e dɔng fi i tsang se ni nɛt, idɔng fi i te ba di sak mo ni nyang. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Di sɛ yin mo na awon, nɔng in da bin shara ide wɛshɛk, kyɔn ti i di se. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Sot yin ni kutsitsɛng ni irèn kusot na bafɛ́ amatse; ras yin kutomong ne kaakyi kawat fi i sɛ yin. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Won kucɛɛt yin ni ku shining ni itek, ni ku ta tɛ ba di zaat ntɔk, nɔng i da bin rēn yin irèn fi i di ki bun yin ni ifɛ̀ sak na kaangan ba.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ite show igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />ATikikus da ki tak yin kaakyɛ fi in di se. Iwu yet aruneng fɛ́ ba di te iyɛ́, anet itomong ayɛt atsak, afi ifiri yit ni itomong aTisa. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />In tsin ku yirik sak ni yin nɔng a ki tak yin fok in se yit anɛ, na bang ki te yin gbagba. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />A da bɛ́ gung nɛ anet yin aOnisimus, aruneng itomong atsak fɛ́ ba shim. Ba da ki tak yin ngma ikyɛng fi in di se yit ayɛt e azeng.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Afidang inyang hom Aristakus, ki te show yin, nɛ aMarkus arunyining aBarnabas. (Iwu fi in man ki jɛk yin naton wu, fok kɛ a bɛ ni yin ni ku shan yin ni mbɔk nfifaa.) <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />AYeso fɛ́ ba ku yes aJustus, ki te show yin bà. Iba wu kyɛk fɛ́ ba yet baYahuda ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni itomong igwɔm Adakunom ni imi, ba mi di sak imen iyɛ makiyi. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Anet yin Apafaras, asam Anet-Isheshek aYeso, ki te show yin. Iwu yɔng a se ni igigashang ira awon nek iyin, nɔng i da tup yin atak gak ayɛt kushim Adakunom, kyem yin ni ite iyɛ agap. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Imi da kyem in nɔɔk kanu kuri kutomong fɛ́ Apafaras se ne nek iyin nɛ bafɛ́ aLaudikiya, nɛ aHirapolis. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Afidang yit abok aLuka, nɛ aDemas ki te show yin. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Di te show yin baruneng yit fɛ́ ba se na aLaudikiya, nɛ aNimfa, nɛ bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba nyiis ari wu.<verse eid="COL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Ama fi i mi fa yin kufumung kang, te nyɛk yin na ba fa iko sak na bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aLaudikiya ni iyin fa yin kuyɔng fi ku ne ni ba bà.<verse eid="COL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Tak yin Akipus fok, &lt;&lt;Na te nyɛk na gang kutomong fɛ́ Atisa mi ku nɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Imi aBulus, wu in ki jɛk yin ashow yong ni kubɔk hom. Yiring yin ni inyang fɛ́ ba di rosom mo. Won itek Adakunom ni se gung ni yin.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>